[32m+[m[32m## Query Models[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSprint 22 introduced:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`app/models/query.py`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis module contains:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### SortOrder[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### CaseSortField[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### CaseQuery[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### SortOrder[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSortOrder defines the accepted sorting directions:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32masc[m
[32m+[m[32mdesc[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExample:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mGET /support/cases?sort_order=desc[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mUnsupported values are rejected before repository execution.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### CaseSortField[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCaseSortField defines the investigation fields clients may use for sorting:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mtimestamp[m
[32m+[m[32mcustomer_name[m
[32m+[m[32mphone_number[m
[32m+[m[32mstatus[m
[32m+[m[32mcreated_by[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThis prevents clients from passing arbitrary database field names.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt also ensures that Swagger/OpenAPI exposes the accepted values explicitly.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### CaseQuery[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCaseQuery is the validated contract for investigation collection requests.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mSupported fields:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mpage[m
[32m+[m[32mpage_size[m
[32m+[m[32mcustomer_name[m
[32m+[m[32mphone_number[m
[32m+[m[32mcreated_by[m
[32m+[m[32mstatus[m
[32m+[m[32msort_by[m
[32m+[m[32msort_order[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDefault values:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mpage = 1[m
[32m+[m[32mpage_size = 20[m
[32m+[m[32msort_by = timestamp[m
[32m+[m[32msort_order = desc[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mValidation rules:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mpage must be at least 1[m
[32m+[m[32mpage_size must be between 1 and 100[m
[32m+[m[32msort_by must be a supported CaseSortField[m
[32m+[m[32msort_order must be asc or desc[m
