[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- The default sorting behaviour returns newer investigation records before older records.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Pagination Models[m
