[32m+[m[32mGeneric pagination reduces duplication.[m
[32m+[m[32mDeterministic secondary sorting stabilizes paginated results.[m
[32m+[m[32mOwnership must be enforced server-side.[m
[32m+[m[32mResponse models must reflect intended public capabilities.[m
